WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:08.207 line:92%
♪ ♪

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.476 line:92%
Decker.

00:00:10.509 --> 00:00:14.080
Agent Jackson, you'll be working
with him on this mission.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.716
Agent Jackson,
let's get one thing straight.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:18.384 line:92%
I don't like orders,

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:20.887 line:92%
and I don't play by the rules.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.522 line:92%
I trust you heard of me.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:23.990 line:92%
Actually, no, I haven't.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.826 line:92%
Ooh, hubba hubba.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:32.899 line:92%
♪ ♪

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.267 line:92%
We don't have much time.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.302
The Arachnid agents
have taken over the consulate.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:41.140
We need to get you in and
resolve this from the inside.

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:43.676
We've taken the latest sitrep
of the hostile's position,

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:46.279
and we've reconstructed
a holographic blueprint

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.613 line:92%
of the consulate.

00:00:47.646 --> 00:00:51.918
Save the mouth squirt
for the new recruits, General.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.853
Not gonna by impressed
by any fancy...

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.321 line:92%
technology!

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:58.358
[beeping]
- [shouting]

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:07.900
It's just
a 3-D representation.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.203 line:92%
Pretty standard these days.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.038 line:92%
All right.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.406 line:92%
I know what it is.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:14.807 line:92%
Agent Jackson,

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.443
you will enter through
this AC duct on the south side

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:18.611
- of the building.
- Yes, sir.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:21.180
Decker,
you will be dropped on top,

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:23.983
and then you will gain access
through this elevator shaft.

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:25.885
We want you to go down
to the fourth floor.

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.387
- [gasps]
- Make--

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.190 line:92%
Decker.

00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:32.525 line:92%
You okay?

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.428 line:92%
Heard everything you said.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:38.965 line:92%
Elevator shaft.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.166 line:92%
It's bright.

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:41.801 line:92%
Yeah, it's bright.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.002 line:92%
The terrorists are located

00:01:43.035 --> 00:01:46.072
on the third and fifth floor
of the building.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:48.274
Each floor has six groups
of six men.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.109
What we're gonna want you to do
is stop in the middle

00:01:50.142 --> 00:01:52.678
of the fourth
and pry open the elevator door

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.514 line:92%
and go--

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.415
I just want you to move
through that elevator door

00:01:56.448 --> 00:01:57.550 line:92%
and then go do--

00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:59.819 line:92%
[beeping]

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.189 line:92%
Pry open--

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:05.258 line:92%
[beeping]

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.961
Elevator door.
Go down to the third flo--

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:10.429
Okay, maybe
this isn't gonna work out.

00:02:10.462 --> 00:02:13.266
Why?
What's the matter, General?

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.836
Everybody's putting their hand
in the laser.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.437 line:92%
It's not a laser.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.339 line:92%
It's a hologram.

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:21.741 line:92%
Tomato, tomato.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:26.379
Look, what's with all
the babysitting and handholding?

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:28.981 line:92%
Papa's a big boy.

00:02:29.014 --> 00:02:30.783 line:92%
Let's zoom into the interior.

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:33.152 line:92%
Yeah, let's zoom in.

00:02:33.185 --> 00:02:36.923 line:92%
Oh, boy!

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.425 line:92%
[breathing heavily]

00:02:39.458 --> 00:02:41.627 line:92%
[beeping]

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.362
Let's cut to the chase.
Why am I here?

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:44.463 line:92%
[sighs]

00:02:44.496 --> 00:02:47.166
Your primary target
is your old rival

00:02:47.199 --> 00:02:51.504
from the Cold War,
Nikoli Androkovich.

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:52.738
Now, Androkovich
has been leading--

00:02:52.771 --> 00:02:54.707 line:92%
He's here!

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.708 line:92%
[grunts]

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:57.844 line:92%
Wh--Jackson! Jackson!

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:03.282 line:92%
Wait.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:05.985 line:92%
Good job, Decker.

00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:09.088
Jackson was an undercover agent
for Arachnid.

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:10.990 line:92%
How in the world did you know?

00:03:13.859 --> 00:03:15.895 line:92%
Ain't my first rodeo.

00:03:15.928 --> 00:03:19.098 line:92%
[dramatic music]

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:22.868
[screams]
Hot!

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:24.904 line:92%
Not hot enough.

